{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","$id":"roe.schema.json","title":"ROE（交戰規則）","description":"G0b 離線驗章；Policy Engine 在每個接觸網路的步驟重新驗證。簽署人與核准者只能引用金鑰登錄中的人（D11），ROE 不能引入金鑰。工具與模式用 D13 ID。","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,
"properties":{
"engagement":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/engagement_id"},"version":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"purpose":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","version","purpose"]},
"issued_at":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime","description":"簽署時間；用於判斷簽署時金鑰是否有效（docs/03 §6.1 步驟 4–5）"},
"key_registry_ref":{"type":"string","description":"金鑰登錄位置；必須等於 toolkit.yaml key_registry.location"},
"signatories":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_ref"},"minItems":3,"description":"簽署 ROE 的人：至少含 test_lead、management、infrastructure_owner（validator 檢查）"},
"gate_approvers":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_ref"},"minItems":1,"description":"可核准 G1–G5、GB 的人；G0b 之後的核准者必須在 signatories 或此清單中（docs/03 §6.1 步驟 6）"},
"validity":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"not_before":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime"},"not_after":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime"},"windows":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/window"},"minItems":1}},"required":["not_before","not_after","windows"]},
"targets":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{
  "id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/target_id"},
  "kind":{"enum":["http","database"],"description":"database 只給 Snapshot Service（TCP 轉送），測試 job 不能直連（docs/03 §7.6）"},
  "base_url":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uri"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"kind: http 時必填；必須是 https://（http:// 只允許 localhost、127.0.0.1、[::1]；E-ROE-URL）"},
  "endpoint":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","pattern":"^(\\[[0-9A-Fa-f:.]+\\]|[A-Za-z0-9-]+(\\.[A-Za-z0-9-]+)*):[0-9]{1,5}$"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"kind: database 時必填：host:port 或 [IPv6]:port（不接受裸主機、結尾點與空標籤）"},
  "environment":{"enum":["staging","tester_controlled"],"description":"tester_controlled＝我方控制的設施（例如 canary 伺服器）"},
  "ownership_proof":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"description":"dns_txt／well_known_path 需要 token_ref；platform_project（共用平台網域上的專案，例如 *.supabase.co）需要 platform、project_ref、evidence_ref，且 ROE platform_policies 有同一平台的條款接受紀錄（E-ROE-PLATFORM）。共用平台網域不接受 dns_txt／well_known_path","properties":{"method":{"enum":["dns_txt","well_known_path","platform_project"]},"token_ref":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"platform":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["supabase","vercel","netlify","firebase","render","other"]},{"type":"null"}]},"project_ref":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"evidence_ref":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["method","token_ref"]},
  "build_identity":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"description":"如何讀出目標正在跑的 build（H-B4）：header＝回應標頭 header_name；endpoint＝GET path 後取 json_pointer；none＝無法確認（該目標列入 report-manifest build_unverified_targets）。testresult.observed_build_id 必須等於 run.repo_commit（E-RESULT-BUILD）","properties":{"method":{"enum":["header","endpoint","none"]},"header_name":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9-]+$"},{"type":"null"}]},"path":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","pattern":"^/"},{"type":"null"}]},"json_pointer":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","pattern":"^(/[^/]*)+$"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":["method","header_name","path","json_pointer"]},
  "graphql_paths":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^/"},"uniqueItems":true,"description":"v0.4：這個目標上的 GraphQL 端點路徑（已正規化）。測試案例請求的 graphql_operation 為 query／introspection 時，只有路徑在這份清單中、方法為 GET／POST，才算讀取；其他帶 graphql_operation 的請求一律 S3（E-TC-MUTATION-SCOPE）。省略＝此目標沒有 GraphQL 端點"}},
  "required":["id","kind","base_url","endpoint","environment","ownership_proof","build_identity"]}},
"platform_policies":{"type":"array","description":"共用平台（supabase.co、vercel.app 等）的測試政策接受紀錄；共用平台網域上的目標必須有對應平台的一筆（E-ROE-PLATFORM）","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"platform":{"enum":["supabase","vercel","netlify","firebase","render","other"]},"policy_url":{"type":"string","format":"uri"},"accepted_by":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id"},"accepted_at":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime"},"restrictions":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["platform","policy_url","accepted_by","accepted_at","restrictions"]}},
"test_roles":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{
  "role":{"type":"string"},"description":{"type":"string"},"credential_ref":{"type":"string"},
  "login":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"method":{"enum":["form","api_token","oauth_password","browser_recipe"]},"target_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/target_id"},"login_path":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"recipe_ref":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"mfa":{"enum":["none","totp","other"]},"captcha_bypass":{"enum":["not_needed","staging_bypass_token","blocked"]},"idp":{"enum":["local","oauth_third_party","saml","other"]}},"required":["method","target_id","login_path","recipe_ref","mfa","captcha_bypass","idp"],"description":"Session Provider 的登入方式（docs/03 §7.4）；不含憑證值。captcha_bypass blocked，或 idp oauth_third_party 而沒有 staging 測試 IdP → 該角色的 job 一律 SKIPPED"},
  "whoami":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"type":"string","pattern":"^/"},"expect_json_pointer":{"type":"string","pattern":"^(/[^/]*)+$"},"expect_value_from_role":{"type":"string","description":"此角色在 Session Provider 中的屬性名（例如 user_id），執行時與回應比對"}},"required":["path","expect_json_pointer","expect_value_from_role"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"登入後確認 session 身分的端點；testcase 使用的每個角色都必須有（E-ROE-WHOAMI）"},
  "storage_state_encrypted":{"const":true,"description":"Playwright storageState 只以加密形式存在 Z3"}},
  "required":["role","description","credential_ref","login","whoami","storage_state_encrypted"]}},
"exclusions":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"paths":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"fnmatch 逐段比對；最後一段為 * 代表該前綴與其下任何深度（docs/04 §5 path_may_match）。比對前兩邊都正規化：percent-decode 一次、去掉每段的 ;params、合併 //、解析 . 與 ..、不分大小寫"},"hosts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","pattern":"^(\\*\\.)?[^\\s/*@:\\[\\]]+$|^\\[[0-9A-Fa-f:.]+\\]$"},"description":"主機名稱（比對前正規化：小寫、去結尾點、IDNA）或前導萬用字元 *.example.com（涵蓋所有子網域，不含 example.com 本身）"}},"required":["paths","hosts"]},
"activities":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{
  "allowed_safety_classes":{"type":"array","items":{"enum":["S0","S1","S2"]},"minItems":1},
  "allowed_tools":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/tool_id"},"minItems":1,"description":"D13 工具 ID（tools.yaml 的鍵）"},
  "denied_modes":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/tool_mode"},"description":"D13 tool:mode，精確比對、不允許萬用字元；只能在工具包拒絕清單之上再加"}},
  "required":["allowed_safety_classes","allowed_tools","denied_modes"]},
"rate_limits":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"per_host_rps":{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":0},"max_concurrency":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"s1_request_cap":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"zap_delay_ms_min":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"zap_max_scan_minutes":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":["per_host_rps","max_concurrency","s1_request_cap","zap_delay_ms_min","zap_max_scan_minutes"]},
"stop_conditions":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"description":"覆寫 toolkit.yaml 的預設（docs/03 §7.3）；沒寫的鍵用預設值。validator 檢查覆寫值不比預設寬鬆。",
  "properties":{
  "window_seconds":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"min_window_requests":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},
  "max_5xx_ratio":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":1},"max_consecutive_5xx":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},
  "max_p95_latency_ms":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"baseline_latency_multiplier":{"type":"number","exclusiveMinimum":1},
  "max_conn_error_ratio":{"type":"number","minimum":0,"maximum":1},
  "rate_limited_429":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"count":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"window_seconds":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"sustain_minutes":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":["count","window_seconds","sustain_minutes"]},
  "health_url":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uri"},{"type":"null"}]},
  "health_fail_count":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"health_interval_seconds":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},
  "out_of_scope_blocked_per_job":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},
  "contacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1}},
  "required":["contacts"]},
"data_handling":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"data_class":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/data_class"},"synthetic_data_attested":{"const":true},"pii_scan_before_b4":{"type":"boolean"},"retention_days":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"ROE 只能再縮短保存天數：必須 ≤ engagement.yaml retention_days（E-ROE-RETENTION）且 ≤ toolkit.yaml 的組織上限（E-RETENTION）"}},"required":["data_class","synthetic_data_attested","pii_scan_before_b4","retention_days"]},
"integrations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"mode":{"enum":["sandbox","test","disabled"]}},"required":["name","mode"]}},
"upstream_llm_providers":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"provider":{"type":"string"},"terms_confirmed_by":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id"},"spend_cap_usd":{"type":"number","minimum":0}},"required":["provider","terms_confirmed_by","spend_cap_usd"]}},
"relay":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"mode":{"enum":["scripted","adaptive"],"description":"scripted＝testcase 的 script_turns 固定使用者輪次（E-TC-SCRIPT）；adaptive＝relay 模型依回應產生下一輪，只允許 assurance_profile full（E-ROE-RELAY-MODE）"},"models":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"description":"models.yaml 的 key；也必須在委任設定對該資料等級的允許清單中"},"max_turns":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"max_spend_usd_per_job":{"type":"number","minimum":0},"max_spend_usd_per_run":{"type":"number","minimum":0}},"required":["mode","models","max_turns","max_spend_usd_per_job","max_spend_usd_per_run"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Z3→Z1 relay（docs/03 §7.5）；null＝不允許多輪測試"},
"db_access":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{
  "target_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/target_id","description":"kind: database 的 ROE 目標"},
  "endpoint":{"type":"string","pattern":"^(\\[[0-9A-Fa-f:.]+\\]|[A-Za-z0-9-]+(\\.[A-Za-z0-9-]+)*):[0-9]{1,5}$","description":"必須等於該目標的 endpoint"},
  "snapshot_method":{"enum":["provider_api","logical_dump","none"],"description":"none → 不能執行 S2"},
  "snapshot_credential_ref":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},
  "oracle_readonly_credential_ref":{"type":"string"},
  "oracle_readonly_attested":{"const":true,"description":"基礎設施擁有者聲明 oracle 憑證只有 oracle_tables 的 SELECT 權限"},
  "oracle_tables":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1},
  "seed_manifest_ref":{"type":"string"},
  "seed_manifest_sha256":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256","description":"v0.4：seed manifest 內容的 hash（sha256(JCS)），由基礎設施擁有者在 ROE 上簽署。create_only_endpoints、state_changing_reads、read_only_endpoints 直接決定一個請求是 S1 還是 S3，所以必須由基礎設施擁有者簽署，而不只是在 G4 綁 hash（E-ROE-SEED-MANIFEST）"}},
  "required":["target_id","endpoint","snapshot_method","snapshot_credential_ref","oracle_readonly_credential_ref","oracle_readonly_attested","oracle_tables","seed_manifest_ref","seed_manifest_sha256"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"docs/03 §7.6；由基礎設施擁有者在 ROE 中簽署"},
"legal_review":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"description":"docs/06 §2.1.1；attested_by 的簽章必須出現在本 ROE 的 signatures 中（L-3）",
  "properties":{
  "attested_by":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id"},
  "attested_at":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime"},
  "jurisdictions":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1},
  "scope":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"computer_misuse":{"$ref":"#/$defs/scope_item"},"privacy":{"$ref":"#/$defs/scope_item"},"cross_border":{"$ref":"#/$defs/scope_item"},"third_party_platform_policy":{"$ref":"#/$defs/scope_item"},"upstream_llm_terms":{"$ref":"#/$defs/scope_item"},"component_licenses":{"$ref":"#/$defs/scope_item"}},"required":["computer_misuse","privacy","cross_border","third_party_platform_policy","upstream_llm_terms","component_licenses"]},
  "reference_doc_sha256":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256"},
  "expires_at":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime"}},
  "required":["attested_by","attested_at","jurisdictions","scope","reference_doc_sha256","expires_at"]},
"incident_response":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"description":"v0.4：測試造成意外時的處理。contacts 是金鑰登錄中的人；notify_within_hours 1–72；covers 必須涵蓋 data_exposure（測試回應中出現真實個資或機密）、third_party_side_effect（觸發真實的寄信、簡訊、金流）、shared_platform_impact（波及共享平台上的其他租戶）、staging_outage（staging 無法使用）四種；procedure_ref 與 liability_ref 必填（E-ROE-INCIDENT）。工具包只檢查宣告存在，不判斷程序內容","properties":{"contacts":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/person_id"},"minItems":1},"notify_within_hours":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":72},"covers":{"type":"array","items":{"enum":["data_exposure","third_party_side_effect","shared_platform_impact","staging_outage"]},"uniqueItems":true},"procedure_ref":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"liability_ref":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"責任歸屬與賠償條款的文件參照（例如服務合約中的安全測試條款）"}},"required":["contacts","notify_within_hours","covers","procedure_ref","liability_ref"]},
"secrets_verification":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"trufflehog_verify":{"type":"boolean"},"providers":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["trufflehog_verify","providers"]},
"signatures":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/signature"},"minItems":1,"description":"每位 signatory 與 legal_review.attested_by 各一份"}},
"required":["engagement","issued_at","key_registry_ref","signatories","gate_approvers","validity","targets","platform_policies","test_roles","exclusions","activities","rate_limits","stop_conditions","data_handling","integrations","upstream_llm_providers","relay","db_access","legal_review","incident_response","secrets_verification","signatures"],
"$defs":{"scope_item":{"anyOf":[{"const":true},{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"value":{"const":false},"not_applicable_reason":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"required":["value","not_applicable_reason"]}]}}}
